  {
   "id": "matematicas-2013-septiembre-5",
   "n": 5,
   "num": 1,
   "bloque": "Opción B",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sea \\(f:(0,+\\infty)\\to\\mathbb R\\) la función definida por \\(f(x)=\\dfrac{2\\ln(x)}{x^2}\\) (donde \\(\\ln\\) denota el logaritmo neperiano).",
    "apartados": [
     "(1,75 p.) Determina los intervalos de crecimiento y de decrecimiento y los extremos relativos de \\(f\\) (abscisas donde se obtienen y valores que se alcanzan).",
     "(0,75 p.) Estudia y determina las asíntotas de la gráfica de \\(f\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>El dominio es \\((0,+\\infty)\\)<i class='n' data-t='why'>Rayamos la parte de la recta que queda fuera del dominio: ahí la función no está definida y no se estudia.</i> y \\(f\\) es derivable en él: no hay puntos «problemáticos». Estudiamos el signo de \\(f'\\)<i class='n' data-t='tp'>Dentro de cada intervalo la derivada no cambia de signo, así que basta sustituir un valor cualquiera del intervalo para conocer su signo.</i>.</p>\\[f'(x)=\\frac{\\frac2x\\cdot x^2-2\\ln x\\cdot2x}{x^4}=\\frac{2x(1-2\\ln x)}{x^4}=\\frac{2(1-2\\ln x)}{x^3}\\]\\[1-2\\ln x=0\\iff\\ln x=\\frac12\\iff\\boxed{x=\\sqrt e}\\]<div class='rs' style='overflow-x:auto;margin:.35rem 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 210 108' width='100%' style='max-width:252px;display:block;margin:auto' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='14.5' fill='currentColor'><path d='M14 52H196' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><path d='M14 56L18 48M18 56L22 48M22 56L26 48M26 56L30 48M30 56L34 48M34 56L38 48' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.1'/><path d='M40 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='40' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>0</text><path d='M114 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='114' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>√e</text><text x='51.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><path d='M65.0 40L101.0 10' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M92.0 11L101.0 10L99.0 19' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='77.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(1) &gt; 0</text><text x='129.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><path d='M143.0 10L179.0 40' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M170.0 39L179.0 40L177.0 31' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='155.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(e) &lt; 0</text></svg></div><p>Luego \\(f\\) crece en \\((0,\\sqrt e)\\) debido a que \\(f'(x)\\gt0\\), y decrece en \\((\\sqrt e,+\\infty)\\) debido a que \\(f'(x)\\lt0\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>Si \\(f'\\gt0\\) en un intervalo, \\(f\\) crece en él; si \\(f'\\lt0\\), decrece.</i>. Alcanza un máximo en \\(x=\\sqrt e\\)<i class='n' data-t='why'>Hay un mínimo donde \\(f\\) pasa de decrecer a crecer y un máximo donde pasa de crecer a decrecer.</i> de valor \\(f(\\sqrt e)=\\frac{2\\cdot\\frac12}e=\\frac1e\\).</p><div class='res'>Crece en \\((0,\\sqrt e)\\), decrece en \\((\\sqrt e,+\\infty)\\). Máximo relativo en \\(\\left(\\sqrt e,\\dfrac1e\\right)\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p><b>Asíntota vertical.</b> El único punto frontera del dominio es \\(x=0\\):</p>\\[\\lim_{x\\to0^+}\\frac{2\\ln x}{x^2}=\\frac{-\\infty}{0^+}=-\\infty\\]<p>\\(x=0\\) es asíntota vertical.</p><p><b>Asíntota horizontal.</b></p>\\[\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\frac{2\\ln x}{x^2}=\\left[\\frac\\infty\\infty\\right]\\overset{\\text{L'H}}=\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\frac{2/x}{2x}=\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\frac1{x^2}=0\\]<p>\\(y=0\\) es asíntota horizontal en \\(+\\infty\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de L'Hôpital: si el límite de \\(\\frac fg\\) da \\(\\frac00\\) o \\(\\frac\\infty\\infty\\), es igual al límite de \\(\\frac{f'}{g'}\\), si este existe.</i>. No hay oblicua, porque hay horizontal<i class='n' data-t='why'>En un mismo extremo (\\(+\\infty\\)) no puede haber a la vez asíntota horizontal y oblicua.</i>.</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 180' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polyline points='47.5,516.3 49.4,376.7 51.3,283.6 53.2,219.3 55.2,173.9 57.1,141.1 59.0,116.9 60.9,98.8 62.8,85.2 64.7,74.8 66.6,66.8 68.5,60.6 70.4,55.7 72.3,52.0 74.2,49.0 76.1,46.7 78.0,44.9 79.9,43.6 81.8,42.5 83.7,41.7 85.6,41.1 87.5,40.7 89.4,40.4 91.4,40.3 93.3,40.2 95.2,40.2 97.1,40.2 99.0,40.3 100.9,40.4 102.8,40.6 104.7,40.8 106.6,41.0 108.5,41.2 110.4,41.5 112.3,41.7 114.2,41.9 116.1,42.2 118.0,42.5 119.9,42.7 121.8,43.0 123.7,43.2 125.7,43.5 127.6,43.7 129.5,44.0 131.4,44.2 133.3,44.4 135.2,44.7 137.1,44.9 139.0,45.1 140.9,45.4 142.8,45.6 144.7,45.8 146.6,46.0 148.5,46.2 150.4,46.4 152.3,46.6 154.2,46.8 156.1,47.0 158.0,47.1 159.9,47.3 161.9,47.5 163.8,47.7 165.7,47.8 167.6,48.0 169.5,48.1 171.4,48.3 173.3,48.4 175.2,48.6 177.1,48.7 179.0,48.9 180.9,49.0 182.8,49.1 184.7,49.3 186.6,49.4 188.5,49.5 190.4,49.6 192.3,49.8 194.2,49.9 196.2,50.0 198.1,50.1 200.0,50.2 201.9,50.3 203.8,50.4 205.7,50.5 207.6,50.6 209.5,50.7 211.4,50.8 213.3,50.9 215.2,51.0 217.1,51.1 219.0,51.2 220.9,51.2 222.8,51.3 224.7,51.4 226.6,51.5 228.5,51.6 230.4,51.6 232.4,51.7 234.3,51.8 236.2,51.9 238.1,51.9 240.0,52.0 241.9,52.1 243.8,52.1 245.7,52.2 247.6,52.3 249.5,52.3 251.4,52.4 253.3,52.5 255.2,52.5 257.1,52.6 259.0,52.6 260.9,52.7 262.8,52.7 264.7,52.8 266.6,52.9 268.6,52.9 270.5,53.0 272.4,53.0 274.3,53.1 276.2,53.1' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='94.5' cy='40.2' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='98.5' y='34.2'>máx</text><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 57.3H294.0M31.5 174.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='69.7' y1='54.3' x2='69.7' y2='60.3' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='66.7' y='71.3' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='107.9' y1='54.3' x2='107.9' y2='60.3' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='104.9' y='71.3' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='146.2' y1='54.3' x2='146.2' y2='60.3' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='143.2' y='71.3' font-size='10'>3</text><line x1='184.4' y1='54.3' x2='184.4' y2='60.3' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='181.4' y='71.3' font-size='10'>4</text><line x1='222.6' y1='54.3' x2='222.6' y2='60.3' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='219.6' y='71.3' font-size='10'>5</text><line x1='260.9' y1='54.3' x2='260.9' y2='60.3' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='257.9' y='71.3' font-size='10'>6</text><line x1='28.5' y1='150.7' x2='34.5' y2='150.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='15.5' y='154.7' font-size='10'>-2</text><line x1='28.5' y1='104.0' x2='34.5' y2='104.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='15.5' y='108.0' font-size='10'>-1</text></svg></div><div class='res'>Asíntota vertical \\(x=0\\); asíntota horizontal \\(y=0\\) en \\(+\\infty\\)</div></div>"
    }
