  {
   "id": "matematicas-2013-septiembre-6",
   "n": 6,
   "num": 2,
   "bloque": "Opción B",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sea \\(g:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) la función definida por \\(g(x)=-x^2+6x-5\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(0,75 p.) Halla la ecuación de la recta normal a la gráfica de \\(g\\) en el punto de abscisa \\(x=4\\).",
     "(1,75 p.) Esboza el recinto limitado por la gráfica de \\(g\\) y la recta \\(x-2y+2=0\\). Calcula el área de este recinto."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(g(4)=-16+24-5=3\\) y \\(g'(x)=-2x+6\\Rightarrow g'(4)=-2\\). La normal tiene pendiente \\(-\\frac1{g'(4)}=\\frac12\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>Dos rectas de pendientes \\(m\\) y \\(m'\\) son perpendiculares si \\(m\\cdot m'=-1\\).</i>:</p>\\[y-3=\\frac12(x-4)\\iff y=\\frac x2+1\\]<div class='res'>\\(y=\\dfrac x2+1\\), es decir, \\(x-2y+2=0\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>La recta \\(x-2y+2=0\\), o sea \\(y=\\frac x2+1\\), es precisamente la normal del apartado a). Puntos de corte con \\(g\\):</p>\\[-x^2+6x-5=\\frac x2+1\\iff2x^2-11x+12=0\\iff x=\\frac{11\\pm5}4\\iff x=\\frac32\\ \\text{ o }\\ x=4\\]<div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 220' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polygon points='99.3,104.1 102.1,98.7 104.8,93.5 107.6,88.5 110.3,83.8 113.1,79.3 115.8,75.1 118.6,71.0 121.4,67.2 124.1,63.6 126.9,60.3 129.6,57.2 132.4,54.3 135.1,51.7 137.9,49.2 140.6,47.0 143.4,45.1 146.1,43.4 148.9,41.9 151.7,40.6 154.4,39.5 157.2,38.7 159.9,38.2 162.7,37.8 165.4,37.7 168.2,37.8 170.9,38.2 173.7,38.7 176.4,39.5 179.2,40.6 181.9,41.9 184.7,43.4 187.5,45.1 190.2,47.0 193.0,49.2 195.7,51.7 198.5,54.3 201.2,57.2 204.0,60.3 206.7,63.6 209.5,67.2 209.5,67.2 206.7,68.1 204.0,69.1 201.2,70.0 198.5,70.9 195.7,71.8 193.0,72.7 190.2,73.7 187.5,74.6 184.7,75.5 181.9,76.4 179.2,77.4 176.4,78.3 173.7,79.2 170.9,80.1 168.2,81.0 165.4,82.0 162.7,82.9 159.9,83.8 157.2,84.7 154.4,85.7 151.7,86.6 148.9,87.5 146.1,88.4 143.4,89.3 140.6,90.3 137.9,91.2 135.1,92.1 132.4,93.0 129.6,94.0 126.9,94.9 124.1,95.8 121.4,96.7 118.6,97.6 115.8,98.6 113.1,99.5 110.3,100.4 107.6,101.3 104.8,102.3 102.1,103.2 99.3,104.1' fill='#b9a4f5' fill-opacity='.55'/><polyline points='59.7,207.7 63.2,196.5 66.7,185.8 70.2,175.4 73.8,165.4 77.3,155.7 80.8,146.5 84.3,137.6 87.9,129.1 91.4,121.0 94.9,113.2 98.4,105.9 102.0,98.9 105.5,92.3 109.0,86.1 112.5,80.2 116.1,74.7 119.6,69.6 123.1,64.9 126.6,60.6 130.2,56.6 133.7,53.0 137.2,49.8 140.7,47.0 144.3,44.5 147.8,42.4 151.3,40.7 154.8,39.4 158.4,38.5 161.9,37.9 165.4,37.7 168.9,37.9 172.5,38.5 176.0,39.4 179.5,40.7 183.1,42.4 186.6,44.5 190.1,47.0 193.6,49.8 197.2,53.0 200.7,56.6 204.2,60.6 207.7,64.9 211.3,69.6 214.8,74.7 218.3,80.2 221.8,86.1 225.4,92.3 228.9,98.9 232.4,105.9 235.9,113.2 239.5,121.0 243.0,129.1 246.5,137.6 250.0,146.5 253.6,155.7 257.1,165.4 260.6,175.4 264.1,185.8 267.7,196.5 271.2,207.7' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><polyline points='20.0,130.7 106.7,101.6 193.3,72.6 280.0,43.6' fill='none' stroke='#f0a30a' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='99.3' cy='104.1' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='37.3' y='98.1'>(3/2, 7/4)</text><circle cx='209.5' cy='67.2' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='215.5' y='61.2'>(4,3)</text><text x='235.9' y='120.3' fill='#2f6df0' font-size='12'>g</text><text x='205.1' y='27.4' fill='#f0a30a' font-size='10'>x − 2y + 2 = 0</text><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 155.7H294.0M33.2 214.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='77.3' y1='152.7' x2='77.3' y2='158.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='74.3' y='169.7' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='121.4' y1='152.7' x2='121.4' y2='158.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='118.4' y='169.7' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='165.4' y1='152.7' x2='165.4' y2='158.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='162.4' y='169.7' font-size='10'>3</text><line x1='209.5' y1='152.7' x2='209.5' y2='158.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='206.5' y='169.7' font-size='10'>4</text><line x1='253.6' y1='152.7' x2='253.6' y2='158.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='250.6' y='169.7' font-size='10'>5</text><line x1='30.2' y1='126.2' x2='36.2' y2='126.2' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='17.2' y='130.2' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='30.2' y1='96.7' x2='36.2' y2='96.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='17.2' y='100.7' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='30.2' y1='67.2' x2='36.2' y2='67.2' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='17.2' y='71.2' font-size='10'>3</text><line x1='30.2' y1='37.7' x2='36.2' y2='37.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='17.2' y='41.7' font-size='10'>4</text></svg></div><p>Entre ellos la parábola queda por encima de la recta (en \\(x=2\\): \\(g(2)=3\\gt2\\)):</p>\\[A=\\int_{3/2}^4\\left(-x^2+6x-5-\\frac x2-1\\right)dx=\\Bigl[-\\frac{x^3}3+\\frac{11x^2}4-6x\\Bigr]_{3/2}^4=-\\frac43-\\left(-\\frac{63}{16}\\right)=\\frac{125}{48}\\]<div class='res'>Área \\(=\\dfrac{125}{48}\\approx2{,}60\\ u^2\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
    {
     "tema": "funciones",
     "tipo": "tang",
     "apartados": "a"
