  {
   "id": "matematicas-2013-septiembre-7",
   "n": 7,
   "num": 3,
   "bloque": "Opción B",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Considera el siguiente sistema de ecuaciones lineales \\[\\begin{cases}2x-4y+6z=6\\\\my+2z=m+1\\\\-3x+6y-3mz=-9\\end{cases}\\]",
    "apartados": [
     "(1,75 p.) Discute el sistema según los valores del parámetro \\(m\\).",
     "(0,75 p.) Resuélvelo para \\(m=3\\). Para dicho valor de \\(m\\), calcula, si es posible, una solución en la que \\(y=0\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'>\\[A=\\begin{pmatrix}2&-4&6\\\\0&m&2\\\\-3&6&-3m\\end{pmatrix}\\qquad A^*=\\left(\\begin{array}{ccc|c}2&-4&6&6\\\\0&m&2&m+1\\\\-3&6&-3m&-9\\end{array}\\right)\\]<p>Uso el teorema de Rouché-Frobenius<i class='n' data-t='th'>Rouché-Frobenius: el sistema es compatible si y solo si \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=\\operatorname{rg}A^*\\); determinado si ese rango es el número de incógnitas, indeterminado si es menor.</i>. Calculo \\(|A|\\) por la regla de Sarrus<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Sarrus: se suman los productos de la diagonal principal y de los dos triángulos con un lado paralelo a ella (en verde) y se restan los de la diagonal secundaria y sus dos triángulos (en rojo).<span style='display:block;margin:6px 0 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 206 106' width='100%' style='max-width:230px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif'><text x='0' y='30' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><text x='0' y='86' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><polygon points='26,10 41,25 56,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='41' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='56' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><polygon points='103,10 118,25 88,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='118' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='88' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='103' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='180,10 150,25 165,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='150' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='165' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='180' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='56,66 41,81 26,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='26' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='56' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='41' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='88,66 118,81 103,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='103' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='88' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='118' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='165,66 150,81 180,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='180' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='165' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/></svg></span></i>:</p>\\[|A|=\\begin{vmatrix}2&-4&6\\\\0&m&2\\\\-3&6&-3m\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(- 6 m^{2}+24+0\\bigr)-\\bigl(- 18 m+24+0\\bigr)\\]\\[=-6m^2+18m=-6m(m-3)\\]\\[|A|=0\\iff\\boxed{m=0}\\ \\text{ o }\\ \\boxed{m=3}\\]<p><b>• Si </b>\\(m\\neq0,3\\)<b>:</b> \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=3=\\operatorname{rg}A^*\\). <b>Sistema compatible determinado.</b></p><p><b>• Si </b>\\(m=0\\)<b>:</b> \\(A^*=\\left(\\begin{array}{ccc|c}2&-4&6&6\\\\0&0&2&1\\\\-3&6&0&-9\\end{array}\\right)\\). El menor \\(\\begin{vmatrix}2&6\\\\0&2\\end{vmatrix}=4\\neq0\\) (filas 1 y 2, columnas 1 y 3): \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=2\\). Menor de \\(A^*\\) de las columnas 1, 3 y 4:</p>\\[\\begin{vmatrix}2&6&6\\\\0&2&1\\\\-3&0&-9\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(-36-18+0\\bigr)-\\bigl(-36+0+0\\bigr)\\]\\[=-18\\neq0\\]<p>\\(\\operatorname{rg}A^*=3\\neq\\operatorname{rg}A\\). <b>Sistema incompatible.</b></p><p><b>• Si </b>\\(m=3\\)<b>:</b> \\(A^*=\\left(\\begin{array}{ccc|c}2&-4&6&6\\\\0&3&2&4\\\\-3&6&-9&-9\\end{array}\\right)\\). La tercera fila es la primera multiplicada por \\(-\\frac32\\), y \\(\\begin{vmatrix}2&-4\\\\0&3\\end{vmatrix}=6\\neq0\\): \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=\\operatorname{rg}A^*=2\\lt3\\). <b>Sistema compatible indeterminado.</b></p><div class='res'>Si \\(m\\neq0,3\\): compatible determinado. Si \\(m=0\\): incompatible. Si \\(m=3\\): compatible indeterminado</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Con \\(m=3\\) elimino la tercera ecuación (proporcional a la primera). Tomo \\(z=t\\):</p>\\[\\begin{cases}2x-4y+6z=6\\\\3y+2z=4\\end{cases}\\Rightarrow y=\\frac{4-2t}3,\\quad x=3+2y-3t=\\frac{17-13t}3\\]<p>Para que \\(y=0\\): \\(4-2t=0\\iff t=2\\), y entonces \\(x=\\frac{17-26}3=-3\\), \\(z=2\\).</p><div class='res'>\\(x=\\dfrac{17-13t}3,\\ y=\\dfrac{4-2t}3,\\ z=t\\), \\(t\\in\\mathbb R\\). La solución con \\(y=0\\) es \\((-3,0,2)\\)</div><i class='n' data-t='tp'>Comprobación de \\((-3,0,2)\\): \\(-6+12=6\\) ✓, \\(0+4=4\\) ✓, \\(9-18=-9\\) ✓.</i></div>"
    }
   ],
