   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>El plano contiene a \\(\\overrightarrow{AB}=(-2,3,-1)\\) y \\(\\overrightarrow{AC}=(1,1,0)\\). Su vector normal es perpendicular a ambos:</p>\\[\\vec n=\\overrightarrow{AB}\\times\\overrightarrow{AC}=\\begin{vmatrix}\\vec i&\\vec j&\\vec k\\\\-2&3&-1\\\\1&1&0\\end{vmatrix}=(1,\\,-1,\\,-5)\\]<p>El plano es de la forma \\(x-y-5z+D=0\\) y contiene a \\(A(1,0,2)\\): \\(1-10+D=0\\iff D=9\\).</p><div class='res'>\\(x-y-5z+9=0\\)</div><i class='n' data-t='tp'>Comprobación: \\(B\\): \\(-1-3-5+9=0\\) ✓; \\(C\\): \\(2-1-10+9=0\\) ✓.</i></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>El plano \\(x-y-5z+9=0\\) es el del apartado a).</p><p><b>Paso 1. Recta perpendicular al plano por el punto.</b> Como la recta \\(s\\) y el plano \\(\\pi\\) son perpendiculares, el vector normal del plano es paralelo al vector director de la recta<i class='n' data-t='why'>Si la recta es perpendicular al plano, su dirección es la del vector normal del plano: por eso sirve \\(\\vec n\\) como vector director.</i>: \\(\\vec d=\\vec n=(1,\\ -1,\\ -5)\\). Pasa por \\(D(1,\\ 0,\\ 4)\\):</p>\\[s\\equiv\\begin{cases}x=1+t\\\\y=-t\\\\z=4-5t\\end{cases}\\]<p><b>Paso 2. Punto de corte.</b> Sustituyo las paramétricas de \\(s\\) en \\(\\pi\\equiv x-y-5z+9=0\\):</p>\\[(1+t)-(-t)-5(4-5t)+9=0\\iff 27t-10=0\\iff t=\\frac{10}{27}\\]\\[M\\left(\\frac{37}{27},\\ -\\frac{10}{27},\\ \\frac{58}{27}\\right)\\]<p><b>Paso 3. Punto medio.</b> \\(M\\) es el punto medio entre \\(D\\) y su simétrico \\(D'(a,b,c)\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>El simétrico \\(P'\\) cumple que \\(M\\) es el punto medio del segmento \\(PP'\\): cada coordenada de \\(M\\) es la media de las de \\(P\\) y \\(P'\\).</i>:</p>\\[\\frac{1+a}2=\\frac{37}{27},\\qquad\\frac{b}2=-\\frac{10}{27},\\qquad\\frac{4+c}2=\\frac{58}{27}\\]\\[a=\\frac{47}{27},\\qquad b=-\\frac{20}{27},\\qquad c=\\frac{8}{27}\\]<div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":48,\"el\":27,\"p\":[[\"poly\",[[-0.14,1.081,1.556],[2.881,1.197,2.137],[2.881,-1.822,2.741],[-0.14,-1.938,2.16]],\"#8b5cf6\",\"#7c3aed\"],[\"txt\",[2.881,-1.822,2.741],\"π\",\"#7c3aed\",4,0],[\"line\",[0.87,0.13,4.648],[1.87,-0.87,-0.352],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[1.87,-0.87,-0.352],\"s\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"vec\",[0.889,0.111,4.556],[1.12,-0.12,3.401],\"#16a34a\",\"d\",4,-4],[\"vec\",[2.525,-0.37,2.148],[2.756,-0.601,0.993],\"#dc2626\",\"n\",4,-4],[\"line\",[1.289,-0.289,2.556],[1.712,-0.289,2.556],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"line\",[1.712,-0.289,2.556],[1.794,-0.37,2.148],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"pt\",[1.0,0.0,4.0],\"D\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[1.37,-0.37,2.148],\"M\",8,12],[\"pt\",[1.741,-0.741,0.296],\"D′\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"recta\",\"vector normal\",\"vector director\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 409 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m13sb4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m13sb4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m13sb4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m13sb4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><polygon points='242.0,160.8 130.2,183.5 26.0,103.2 137.8,80.5' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#7c3aed' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='30.0' y='103.2' fill='#7c3aed' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>π</text><line x1='170.4' y1='18.0' x2='97.6' y2='246.0' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='103.6' y='246.0' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>s</text><line x1='169.0' y1='22.2' x2='152.2' y2='74.9' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.4' marker-end='url(#m13sb4d)'/><text x='156.2' y='70.9' fill='#16a34a' font-weight='700'>d</text><line x1='89.7' y1='150.1' x2='72.9' y2='202.7' stroke='#dc2626' stroke-width='2.4' marker-end='url(#m13sb4n)'/><text x='76.9' y='198.7' fill='#dc2626' font-weight='700'>n</text><line x1='139.9' y1='113.4' x2='123.7' y2='120.1' stroke='#475569' stroke-width='1.3'/><line x1='123.7' y1='120.1' x2='117.8' y2='138.6' stroke='#475569' stroke-width='1.3'/><circle cx='161.0' cy='47.6' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='168.0' y='41.6' font-weight='700'>D</text><circle cx='134.0' cy='132.0' r='3.8' fill='#e